Today is Sunday.
I am standing near the window of my apartment.
It is raining very heavily outside.
The Mumbai monsoon has finally arrived.
Those dark clouds in the sky are very beautiful.
Now this weather is very different.
I came to Mumbai five months ago.
That was the month of January.
Five months ago, there was absolutely no rain here.
At that time, this city was very dry.
That weather was also quite mild.
But today this rain is very intense.
These trees outside are looking very green.
I am remembering my first day.
A few months ago, I was completely new here.
Now this city feels like my own.
Today I do not have to go anywhere.
I am just watching this rain.
